msgstr "![Output della cella di codice precedente](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/stern-gerlach-measurements-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/7bcdc19e-1915-4443-98c9-54e6fbec7b62-0.avif)\n"

